        "original_id": "ef30f4e6-d8d5-514e-80af-28d7e3190fb5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hugh Jackman, Christopher Nolan, Jonathan Nolan, Christopher Priest\n- Films: X-Men film series, Kate & Leopold, Van Helsing, The Prestige, The Fountain, Australia, Les Misérables, Prisoners\n- Roles: Wolverine\n- Works: The Prestige novel\n\nFacts:\n- Hugh Jackman is known for his long-running role as Wolverine in the X-Men film series.\n- Hugh Jackman had a lead role in the romantic-comedy fantasy film Kate & Leopold in 2001.\n- Christopher Priest published the novel The Prestige in 1995.\n- Hugh Jackman had a lead role in the action-horror film Van Helsing in 2004.\n- The Prestige is a 2006 British-American mystery thriller film.\n- The Prestige was directed by Christopher Nolan.\n- Christopher Nolan and Jonathan Nolan adapted the screenplay of The Prestige from Christopher Priest's 1995 novel of the same name.\n- Hugh Jackman had a lead role in The Prestige in 2006.\n- Hugh Jackman had a lead role in the epic fantasy drama The Fountain in 2006.\n- Hugh Jackman had a lead role in the epic historical romantic drama Australia in 2008.\n- Hugh Jackman had a lead role in the film version of Les Misérables in 2012.\n- Hugh Jackman had a lead role in the thriller Prisoners in 2013.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
